What is the output of the following if-else snippet?
int a = 5, b = 10;
if (a > 0 || ++b > 10) {
    System.out.println(a + " " + b);
}

What will be printed by the following if-else ladder?
int marks = 72;
if (marks >= 90) System.out.println("A");
else if (marks >= 75) System.out.println("B");
else if (marks >= 60) System.out.println("C");
else System.out.println("D");

What is the output of the following nested if-else code?
int x = 10;
if (x > 5)
    if (x < 8) System.out.println("One");
    else System.out.println("Two");
else
    System.out.println("Three");

What will be the output of the following switch code?
int day = 2;
switch (day) {
    case 1: System.out.print("Mon ");
    case 2: System.out.print("Tue ");
    case 3: System.out.print("Wed "); break;
    default: System.out.print("Sun");
}

What will be printed by the following loop with jump statements?
int sum = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
    if (i == 3) continue;
    if (i == 5) break;
    sum += i;
}
System.out.println(sum);

How many times will "Hi" be printed by this nested loop?
for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
    for (int j = 1; j <= 2; j++) {
        System.out.println("Hi");
    }
}

What will be the output of the following method overloading code?
class Test {
    static void printVal(int x) { System.out.println("int: " + x); }
    static void printVal(double x) { System.out.println("double: " + x); }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        printVal('A');
    }
}

What will be the output of this function call?
static int calc(int a, int b) {
    return a * 2 + b;
}
public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(calc(3, 4));
}

What is the output of:
int x = 10;
System.out.println(x++ + ++x);

What is the output of the following function code?
static void change(int x) {
    x = x + 10;
}
public static void main(String[] args) {
    int num = 5;
    change(num);
    System.out.println(num);
}

